msgstr "Backtrace zawěsćene w %1"

#: debugger.cpp:106
msgid "Cannot create a file in which to save the backtrace"
msgstr "Njemóžu dataju stworić za zawěsćenje backtracea"

#: debugger.cpp:111
msgid "Select Filename"
msgstr "Mjeno dataje wubrać"

#: debugger.cpp:119
msgid "A file named \"%1\" already exists. Are you sure you want to overwrite it?"
msgstr "Dataja z mjenom \"%1\" hižo eksistuje. Chceće ju woprawdźe přepisać?"

#: debugger.cpp:121
msgid "Overwrite File?"
msgstr "Dataju přepisać?"

#: debugger.cpp:122
msgid "&Overwrite"
msgstr "&Přepisać"

#: debugger.cpp:134
msgid "Cannot open file %1 for writing"
msgstr "Njemóžu do dataje %1 pisać"

#: debugger.cpp:142
msgid "Unable to create a valid backtrace."
msgstr "Njemóžu korektny backtrace stworić."

#: debugger.cpp:143
msgid ""
"This backtrace appears to be of no use.\n"
"This is probably because your packages are built in a way which prevents "
"creation of proper backtraces, or the stack frame was seriously corrupted in "
"the crash.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutón backtrace njeje wužitny.\n"
"Najskerje to na tym zaleži, zo su waše pakćiki tak stworjene, zo "
"njehodźi so korektny backtrace stworić, abo stack bu zničeny.\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:152
msgid "Loading backtrace..."
msgstr "Čitam backtrace..."

#: debugger.cpp:175
msgid ""
"The following options are enabled:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Slědowace opcije su wubrane:\n"
"\n"

#: debugger.cpp:177
msgid ""
"\n"
"As the usage of these options is not recommended - because they can, in rare "
"cases, be responsible for KDE problems - a backtrace will not be generated.\n"
"You need to turn these options off and reproduce the problem again in order "
"to get a backtrace.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dokelž so wužiwanje tutych opcijow njedoporuči - w rědkich padach móža "
"problemy z KDE zawinić - so backtrace njegeneruje.\n"
"Dyrbiće tute opcije hasnyć a problem bjez nich měć, chceće-li backtrace "
"dóstać.\n"

#: debugger.cpp:182
msgid "Backtrace will not be created."
msgstr "Backtrace so njestwori."

#: debugger.cpp:190
msgid "Loading symbols..."
msgstr "Čitam symbole ..."

#: debugger.cpp:212
msgid ""
"System configuration startup check disabled.\n"
msgstr ""
"Žane přepruwowanje systemoweje konfiguracije při startowanju.\n"

#: drbugreport.cpp:54
msgid "You have to edit the description before the report can be sent."
msgstr "Dyrbiće wopisanje připrawić, prjedy hač móže so rozprawa wotpósłać."

#: krashconf.cpp:74
